  "benchmark_rules": [
    "Freeze site envelope, model revision, scenario split and hard constraints before scoring.",
    "Synthetic scenarios prove software behavior only, not physical performance.",
    "Compare incumbent, transparent rules, conventional optimization, robust method where justified, candidate and ablations with disclosed budgets.",
    "Report critical services, recovery, repair burden, fuel/logistics and uncertainty separately.",
    "Unknown, queued, pending or skipped checks are not passes.",
    "No standards-compliance, field-readiness or health-benefit claim without required tests and expert review."
  ],
